      "body": "Analysts have kept Anup Engineering's fair value estimate steady at ₹3,000 per share, citing only marginal tweaks to assumptions for discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E that do not change their overall price target view. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for Feb 03, 2026 to consider and approve the unaudited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and period ended Dec 31, 2025 (company announcement).",
